<title>SINGAPORE: Jurong Eng 1996 orders hit S$125 mln.</title>
<headline>Jurong Eng 1996 orders hit S$125 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jurong Engineering Ltd said on Wednesday it won contracts worth Singapore $125 million in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the biggest contract was a S$78.4 million mechanical electrical works order from the Ministry of Environment for a sewage treatment works.</p>
<p>The contract was won jointly with consortium partners Mitsubishi Corporation and Ishikawajima-Heavy Industries.</p>
<p>The company said the contracts would have no material impact on earnings in the current year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
